      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 模型下载\n\n打开工作流后，ComfyUI 会提示缺少的权重。点击 Download 下载当前模型。\n\nDesktop 会处理下载和保存。使用 Portable 或浏览器时，请按下面的路径保存，然后刷新模型列表：\n\n```text\nComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/PixText-MeanFlow.safetensors\n```\n\n如果浏览器把文件保存成 `model.safetensors`，请改成上面的文件名。连接远程 ComfyUI 时，文件要放在服务器上。\n\n配置和字体随节点提供，不用另下。原来的完整模型包也能继续使用。\n\n[下载当前权重](https://huggingface.co/ATH-MaaS/PixText/resolve/main/models/PixText-MeanFlow/model.safetensors) · [全部模型](https://huggingface.co/ATH-MaaS/PixText)\n\n## Model download\n\nComfyUI shows any missing weights when you open the workflow. Click Download for the selected model.\n\nDesktop handles the download. In Portable or a browser, save the file here, then refresh the model list:\n\n```text\nComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/PixText-MeanFlow.safetensors\n```\n\nRename the file if your browser saves it as `model.safetensors`. For remote ComfyUI, put it on the server.\n\nConfiguration and fonts come with the nodes. Existing complete model packages still work.\n\n[Download selected weights](https://huggingface.co/ATH-MaaS/PixText/resolve/main/models/PixText-MeanFlow/model.safetensors) · [All models](https://huggingface.co/ATH-MaaS/PixText)"
      ],
