      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## OCR 模型下载\n\n先把下面三个文件下载到运行 ComfyUI 的电脑上。\n\n1. [CRAFT 检测模型（ZIP）](https://github.com/JaidedAI/EasyOCR/releases/download/pre-v1.1.6/craft_mlt_25k.zip)\n2. [PP-OCRv6 识别权重（inference.onnx）](https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PP-OCRv6_medium_rec_onnx/resolve/50c7eacafc52fa7bcf4194e8cd08e46f8558504b/inference.onnx?download=true)\n3. [PP-OCRv6 字典配置（inference.yml）](https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PP-OCRv6_medium_rec_onnx/resolve/50c7eacafc52fa7bcf4194e8cd08e46f8558504b/inference.yml?download=true)\n\n解压 CRAFT ZIP，把 `craft_mlt_25k.pth` 放在：\n\n```text\nComfyUI/models/pixtext_ocr/\n```\n\n把两个 PP-OCRv6 文件放在：\n\n```text\nComfyUI/models/pixtext_ocr/PP-OCRv6_medium_rec_onnx/\n```\n\n在 PixText 节点目录中，用运行 ComfyUI 的 Python 安装依赖，然后重启：\n\n```sh\npython -m pip install -r requirements-ocr.txt\n```\n\n文件放好后点击 Run，检查识别出的框，再修改目标文字。\n\n## OCR model downloads\n\nDownload these three files to the computer running ComfyUI.\n\n1. [CRAFT detection model (ZIP)](https://github.com/JaidedAI/EasyOCR/releases/download/pre-v1.1.6/craft_mlt_25k.zip)\n2. [PP-OCRv6 recognition weights (inference.onnx)](https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PP-OCRv6_medium_rec_onnx/resolve/50c7eacafc52fa7bcf4194e8cd08e46f8558504b/inference.onnx?download=true)\n3. [PP-OCRv6 dictionary configuration (inference.yml)](https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PP-OCRv6_medium_rec_onnx/resolve/50c7eacafc52fa7bcf4194e8cd08e46f8558504b/inference.yml?download=true)\n\nExtract the CRAFT ZIP and put `craft_mlt_25k.pth` here:\n\n```text\nComfyUI/models/pixtext_ocr/\n```\n\nSave both PP-OCRv6 files here:\n\n```text\nComfyUI/models/pixtext_ocr/PP-OCRv6_medium_rec_onnx/\n```\n\nFrom the PixText node folder, install dependencies with ComfyUI's Python, then restart:\n\n```sh\npython -m pip install -r requirements-ocr.txt\n```\n\nClick Run, review the detected boxes and enter your corrections."
      ],
